---
// Bold full-bleed hero: abstract artwork background with a dark overlay, white text, one CTA and three stats along the bottom.
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-brand-950">
  <img src="/media/abstract-4.svg" alt="" width="1600" height="1000" class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 h-full w-full object-cover" />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-950 via-brand-950/80 to-brand-950/50" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto flex min-h-[44rem] max-w-6xl flex-col justify-between px-6 pt-28 pb-12 sm:pt-36">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-200 uppercase">Halcyon for small teams</p>

      <h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-8xl">Less noise. More finished work.</h1>

      <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-pretty text-white/80 sm:text-xl">One calm place to plan the week, share progress and protect your team's focus. No pings at midnight, no status meetings, no surprises on Friday.</p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-start gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-button bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-brand-950 shadow-xl shadow-brand-950/40 transition-colors hover:bg-brand-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white">
          <span>Start free today</span>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14" />
            <path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70">Set up in under ten minutes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-20 grid gap-8 border-t border-white/20 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1">
        <dt class="text-sm text-white/70">teams planning their week in Halcyon</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">4,200+</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1">
        <dt class="text-sm text-white/70">fewer status meetings, on average</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">31%</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1">
        <dt class="text-sm text-white/70">of focus time won back per person, each week</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">6 hours</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
